__pycache__/
*.egg-info/
*.pyc
*.log
.DS_Store
config.env

# Personal, machine-local Serena onboarding state (project.yml/cache/memories
# for whoever's local install has this repo activated) -- not shared repo
# config, same rationale as config.env above.
.serena/

# Byproduct of running some other `uv` subcommand (uv lock/add) in this
# directory. docs/INSTALL.md's documented flow is `uv pip install --python
# <external venv> ...` -- uv-as-pip-replacement against a venv this repo
# doesn't own -- which never reads or writes this file. Direct deps are
# already exact-pinned in pyproject.toml, which is this repo's actual
# determinism mechanism.
uv.lock
